---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Retail &amp; Malls — Fusionedge">
<div class="ix">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="ix-w ix-hero">
    <span class="ix-kick">Facility software for malls and retail chains</span>
    <h1><span>Shoppers notice when it breaks.</span><span class="ix-c">Make sure it never does.</span></h1>
    <p class="ix-lead">Escalators, ACs, washrooms, lighting and fire systems across every floor and every store. FusionEdge keeps malls and retail chains running, from the busiest Saturday to the quietest Tuesday.</p>
    <div class="ix-btns">
      <a class="ix-btn pri" href="https://fusionedge.io/request-demo/">Book a demo</a>
      <a class="ix-btn" href="https://fusionedge.io/contact/">Talk to our team</a>
    </div>
    <div class="ix-trust"><span><b>All 26 apps</b> in one plan</span><span>Malls and store chains</span><span>No card needed</span></div>
    <div class="ix-stage">
      <div class="ix-app" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of a FusionEdge Retail &amp; Malls dashboard">
        <div class="ix-chrome"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="u">app.fusionedge.io/sites</span></div>
        <div class="ix-scroll"><div class="ix-ui">
          <div class="ix-side"><span class="">Overview</span><span class="on">Sites</span><span class="">Tickets</span><span class="">Checklists</span><span class="">Energy</span><span class="">Reports</span></div>
          <div class="db"><div class="db-h"><div><b>All sites</b><small>3 malls · 2 stores shown of 46</small></div><div class="sp"><span class="db-pill">Region: All ▾</span><span class="db-pill">This week</span><span class="db-btn">Compare</span></div></div><div class="db-k"><div><small>Sites live</small><strong>46</strong><em class="">3 malls, 43 stores</em></div><div><small>SLA met</small><strong>97.1%</strong><em class="">▲ 1.2%</em></div><div><small>Checklists done</small><strong>94%</strong><em class="">peak days included</em></div><div><small>Needs attention</small><strong>2</strong><em class="r">below 95% SLA</em></div></div><div class="db-pn"><div class="db-pt"><b>Site comparison</b><span>Sorted by name</span></div><div class="db-tb"><div style="grid-template-columns:1.7fr .6fr 1.3fr .7fr .8fr"><span>Site</span><span>Open</span><span>Checklists done</span><span>SLA</span><span>Tickets, 6 wks</span></div><div style="grid-template-columns:1.7fr .6fr 1.3fr .7fr .8fr"><b>City Mall · Pune</b><span>3</span><span style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 30px;gap:6px;align-items:center"><div class="db-bar"><i class="g" style="width:98%"></i></div><span>98%</span></span><i class="db-st g">99.1%</i><svg viewBox="0 0 62 20" style="width:62px"><polyline points="0,5 12,7 24,2 36,10 48,7 60,10" fill="none" stroke="#5D1F72" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><div style="grid-template-columns:1.7fr .6fr 1.3fr .7fr .8fr"><b>Lake Mall · Bengaluru</b><span>7</span><span style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 30px;gap:6px;align-items:center"><div class="db-bar"><i class="w" style="width:91%"></i></div><span>91%</span></span><i class="db-st w">96.2%</i><svg viewBox="0 0 62 20" style="width:62px"><polyline points="0,10 12,6 24,8 36,4 48,2 60,4" fill="none" stroke="#5D1F72" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><div style="grid-template-columns:1.7fr .6fr 1.3fr .7fr .8fr"><b>Store 041 · Mumbai</b><span>1</span><span style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 30px;gap:6px;align-items:center"><div class="db-bar"><i class="g" style="width:100%"></i></div><span>100%</span></span><i class="db-st g">99.8%</i><svg viewBox="0 0 62 20" style="width:62px"><polyline points="0,2 12,10 24,2 36,10 48,10 60,10" fill="none" stroke="#5D1F72" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><div style="grid-template-columns:1.7fr .6fr 1.3fr .7fr .8fr"><b>Store 057 · Delhi</b><span>4</span><span style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 30px;gap:6px;align-items:center"><div class="db-bar"><i class="g" style="width:95%"></i></div><span>95%</span></span><i class="db-st g">97.5%</i><svg viewBox="0 0 62 20" style="width:62px"><polyline points="0,2 12,5 24,5 36,7 48,5 60,7" fill="none" stroke="#5D1F72" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><div style="grid-template-columns:1.7fr .6fr 1.3fr .7fr .8fr"><b>Harbour Mall · Chennai</b><span>9</span><span style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 30px;gap:6px;align-items:center"><div class="db-bar"><i class="r" style="width:86%"></i></div><span>86%</span></span><i class="db-st r">93.4%</i><svg viewBox="0 0 62 20" style="width:62px"><polyline points="0,9 12,7 24,4 36,6 48,2 60,2" fill="none" stroke="#5D1F72" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div></div></div></div>
        </div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="ix-re"><div><b>All 26 apps in one plan</b><p>From asset management to visitor management, with no hidden add-ons.</p></div><div><b>No card, no setup fee</b><p>Book a demo and see it working on your own sites and assets.</p></div><div><b>ISO 27001:2022 certified</b><p>AES-256 encryption, two-factor login and role-based access.</p></div><div><b>Web, mobile and QR</b><p>Technicians work on their phones. Anyone can report an issue by QR.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <hr class="ix-rule">

  <!-- Segments -->
  <section class="ix-w ix-sec">
    <div class="ix-head">
      <div><h2>Which side of retail are you on?</h2><p class="ix-p">Whether you run the building or the stores inside it, the job is the same: keep everything working and prove it.</p></div>
      <a class="ix-link" href="/industries/">All industries →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="ix-segs"><article class="ix-seg"><div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1772760224872-db7c8f49404a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1772760224872-db7c8f49404a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1772760224872-db7c8f49404a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=60 2x" alt="Shopping mall interior with escalators" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div><h3>Shopping malls</h3><p>Many floors, many tenants</p><small><b>Fits</b> · common areas and SLAs</small></article><article class="ix-seg"><div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441986300917-64674bd600d8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441986300917-64674bd600d8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441986300917-64674bd600d8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=60 2x" alt="Clothing store interior" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div><h3>Retail chains</h3><p>Dozens to hundreds of stores</p><small><b>Fits</b> · one standard everywhere</small></article><article class="ix-seg"><div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1604719312566-8912e9227c6a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1604719312566-8912e9227c6a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1604719312566-8912e9227c6a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=60 2x" alt="Grocery store aisle" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div><h3>Supermarkets</h3><p>Cold chain and checkouts</p><small><b>Fits</b> · refrigeration readings</small></article><article class="ix-seg"><div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1774571872279-59580ca46d45?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1774571872279-59580ca46d45?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1774571872279-59580ca46d45?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=60 2x" alt="Colourful storefront with mannequins" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div><h3>High-street stores</h3><p>Single and flagship stores</p><small><b>Fits</b> · vendors and AMCs</small></article></div>

    <!-- Feature photo -->
    <div class="ix-feat">
      <div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1771979788694-bd829698708d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1771979788694-bd829698708d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1771979788694-bd829698708d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2800&q=60 2x" alt="Person riding an escalator in a shopping mall" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div>
      <div class="ix-feat-card"><h2>Built for weekends, sales and festive rush</h2><p class="ix-p">Critical assets checked before the rush, washroom and food-court rounds tracked live during it, and a full record ready after it.</p><a class="ix-link" href="/industries/retail-malls#faq-0">See checklists →</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How it runs -->
  <section class="ix-runs">
    <div class="ix-w ix-runs-g">
      <div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1781967653059-f34f7f4f7365?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1781967653059-f34f7f4f7365?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1781967653059-f34f7f4f7365?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=60 2x" alt="Brightly lit mall with escalators" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div>
      <div>
        <h2>How a mall week runs</h2>
        <p class="ix-p">The same five jobs every week, now in one place and in the order they happen.</p>
        <div class="ix-rows"><div class="ix-row"><b>Plan</b><p>PPM for escalators, lifts, chillers and fire systems is scheduled and assigned.</p></div><div class="ix-row"><b>Clean</b><p>Washroom and food-court rounds are logged with photos, more often at peak hours.</p></div><div class="ix-row"><b>Respond</b><p>Tenant requests become tickets with SLAs, escalated automatically if late.</p></div><div class="ix-row"><b>Bill</b><p>Energy readings are taken at set times, so shared costs are split fairly.</p></div><div class="ix-row"><b>Compare</b><p>Operators see every mall or store side by side on one dashboard.</p></div></div>
        <div class="ix-btns"><a class="ix-btn dark" href="https://fusionedge.io/request-demo/">See the platform</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Side by side -->
  <section class="ix-w ix-sec ix-sbs">
    <div>
      <h2>Two weeks, side by side</h2>
      <p class="ix-p">Same mall, same tenants, same Saturday crowd. The difference is what shoppers see.</p>
      <div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1758448500813-59f3770da00d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1758448500813-59f3770da00d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1758448500813-59f3770da00d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=60 2x" alt="Modern food court with food stalls" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ix-tbl"><div class="th"></div><div class="th">A week on paper</div><div class="th hi">A week with FusionEdge</div><div class="d">Monday</div><div class="o">Escalator checks are signed on a sheet.</div><div class="n">Checks are logged on the phone, with photos.</div><div class="d">Tuesday</div><div class="o">E1’s monthly PPM slips to next week.</div><div class="n">The PPM was scheduled and done on time.</div><div class="d">Wednesday</div><div class="o">Store G-14’s AC fails. The tenant calls the mall office twice.</div><div class="n">A ticket opens with an SLA, and HVAC is alerted.</div><div class="d">Thursday</div><div class="o">The grease trap vendor doesn’t show.</div><div class="n">The vendor is reminded, and the visit is logged.</div><div class="d">Friday</div><div class="o">Fire alarm test results are on paper.</div><div class="n">Test results are stored with time stamps.</div><div class="d">Saturday</div><div class="o">Peak crowd. Washrooms fall behind.</div><div class="n">Rounds step up to every 30 minutes, tracked live.</div><div class="d">Sunday</div><div class="o">The mall head hears about problems from tenants.</div><div class="n">One dashboard shows every floor and every SLA.</div></div>
  </section>

  <!-- Customer story -->
  <section class="ix-story">
    <div class="ix-w">
      <h2>50,000 assets, one 30-minute audit</h2>
      <p class="ix-p">How a leading global organization replaced finance-only records with a digitized, RFID-tagged register in 8 weeks.</p>
      <div class="ix-card">
        <div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1721937127582-ed331de95a04?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1721937127582-ed331de95a04?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1721937127582-ed331de95a04?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=60 2x" alt="Warehouse with boxes and pallets" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div>
        <div class="ix-cb">
          <span class="who">Asset Management &amp; Asset Audit</span>
          <p class="sum">A leading global organization had no idea which assets were in its offices, which were in storage, or which invoice each one belonged to. Its only record was the finance system.</p>
          <div class="ix-stats"><div><b>30 min</b><span>full audit, down from 15 working days</span></div><div><b>−60%</b><span>warehouse rental, from the first month</span></div><div><b>4,120</b><span>ghost assets removed from the books</span></div></div>
          <blockquote>“Every asset is now mapped to its purchase order and invoice, and an audit can run at any time.”</blockquote>
          <div class="ix-btns"><a class="ix-btn dark" href="/stories/asset-management">Read the story</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ix-also"><b>Also running on FusionEdge:</b><div><span>Shopping malls</span><span>Fashion and lifestyle chains</span><span>Supermarkets</span><span>Electronics retailers</span><span>Quick-service restaurants</span><span>Pharmacy chains</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="ix-cta">
    <div class="ix-w">
      <h2>Get ready for the next sale <span>with FusionEdge.</span></h2>
      <p class="ix-p">Book a demo and we will walk you through the modules for your floors, tenants, stores and vendors. No card and no setup fee.</p>
      <div class="ix-btns">
        <a class="ix-btn pri" href="https://fusionedge.io/request-demo/">Book a demo</a>
        <a class="ix-btn" href="https://fusionedge.io/contact/">Contact sales</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
</Layout>

<style>
.ix{--brand:#5D1F72;--ink:#1a1424;--mut:#6b6478;--line:rgba(93,31,114,0.1);--soft:rgba(93,31,114,0.05);--soft2:#f5f5f7;--mint:#eef8f3;--green:#00BF88;--green-ink:#008a62;
  --w:1080px;--pad:clamp(20px,4vw,40px);--sec:clamp(72px,10vw,120px);
  font-family:"Public Sans",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.6;background:#fff;overflow-x:clip}
.ix *,.ix *::before,.ix *::after{box-sizing:border-box;font-family:"Public Sans",sans-serif}
.ix h1,.ix h2,.ix h3,.ix p{margin:0;max-width:none}
.ix a{color:inherit}
.ix-w{max-width:calc(var(--w) + var(--pad)*2);margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--pad)}
.ix h1{font-size:clamp(19px,4.8vw,58px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.035em;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}
.ix h2{font-size:clamp(22px,3.2vw,38px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);text-wrap:balance}
.ix h3{font-size:16px;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-.01em;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink)}
.ix .ix-c{color:var(--brand)}
.ix .ix-p{font-size:15px;color:var(--mut);line-height:1.65}
.ix-kick{display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand);letter-spacing:.01em}
.ix-btns{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
.ix a.ix-btn,.ix a.ix-btn:visited{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:99px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none!important;border:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.18);background:#fff;color:var(--ink)!important;transition:transform .15s,box-shadow .15s,background .15s}
.ix a.ix-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(93,31,114,.12)}
.ix a.ix-btn.pri,.ix a.ix-btn.pri:visited{background:var(--brand);border-color:var(--brand);color:#fff!important}
.ix a.ix-btn.pri:hover{background:var(--brand-d)}
.ix a.ix-btn.dark,.ix a.ix-btn.dark:visited{background:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink);color:#fff!important}
.ix a.ix-link{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink)!important;text-decoration:none}
.ix a.ix-link:hover{color:var(--brand)!important}
.ix-ph{position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;border-radius:14px;color:#8d83a0;font-size:12px;text-align:center;padding:16px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(93,31,114,0.1),#e6f4ee)}
.ix-ph span{max-width:26ch;line-height:1.4;opacity:.85}
.ix-ph img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}

/* Hero */
.ix-hero{text-align:center;padding-top:clamp(48px,7vw,88px)}
.ix-hero h1{margin:14px auto 0;max-width:none}
.ix-hero h1 span{display:block;white-space:nowrap}
.ix-hero .ix-lead{max-width:540px;margin:20px auto 28px;font-size:16px;color:var(--mut);line-height:1.6}
.ix-trust{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:6px 20px;margin-top:20px;font-size:13px;color:var(--mut)}
.ix-trust b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
.ix-trust span+span::before{content:"";display:inline-block;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(93,31,114,0.25);margin:0 14px 2px 0;vertical-align:middle}
.ix-stage{position:relative;margin-top:clamp(36px,5vw,52px)}
.ix-stage::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:-50vw;right:-50vw;top:12%;bottom:0;background:var(--soft);z-index:0}

/* App mock */
.ix-app{position:relative;z-index:1;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.12);border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -24px rgba(93,31,114,.25);overflow:hidden;text-align:left}
.ix-chrome{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;height:34px;padding:0 12px;background:rgba(93,31,114,0.03);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.1)}
.ix-chrome i{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(93,31,114,0.18);display:inline-block}
.ix-chrome .u{margin:0 auto;font-size:10.5px;color:#8d83a0;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.1);border-radius:6px;padding:2px 14px}
.ix-scroll{overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}
.ix-ui{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px minmax(0,1fr);min-width:900px;font-size:11px}
.ix-side{border-right:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.07);padding:14px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
.ix-side span{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:7px;color:#4b4357}
.ix-side span.on{background:var(--soft);color:var(--brand);font-weight:600}
.ix-side em{font-style:normal;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;background:#e5483b;border-radius:99px;padding:0 6px}
.ix-main{padding:12px 14px 6px}
.ix-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px}
.ix-top b{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink)}
.ix-top small{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--mut)}
.ix-tog{display:flex;background:rgba(93,31,114,0.06);border-radius:7px;padding:2px;margin-left:6px}
.ix-tog span{padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;color:var(--mut);font-weight:600;font-size:10px}
.ix-tog span.on{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}
.ix-prog{margin-left:auto;text-align:right;font-size:10px;color:var(--mut)}
.ix-prog b{display:inline;font-size:11px}
.ix-prog em{display:block;width:150px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(93,31,114,0.09);margin-top:4px;overflow:hidden}
.ix-prog em i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--green);border-radius:99px}
.ix-pub{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-size:10.5px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:99px;white-space:nowrap}
.ix-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:170px repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr));border-top:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.07)}
.ix-grid>div{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.06);border-left:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.06);min-height:46px;padding:5px}
.ix-grid>div:nth-child(8n+1){border-left:0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding-left:2px}
.ix-gh{min-height:28px!important;font-size:10px;color:var(--mut);font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:center}
.ix-gh.today{color:var(--brand)}
.ix-av{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:700;background:rgba(93,31,114,0.08);color:var(--brand)}
.ix-av.op{background:#fff;border:1.5px dashed rgba(93,31,114,0.4);color:var(--brand)}
.ix-rn b{display:block;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;line-height:1.2}
.ix-rn small{display:block;font-size:9px;color:var(--mut)}
.ix-ch{display:block;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 6px;line-height:1.25;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600}
.ix-ch small{display:block;font-weight:500;font-size:8.5px;opacity:.8}
.ix-ch.ppm{background:rgba(93,31,114,0.08);color:#5D1F72}
.ix-ch.chk{background:#e8f8f1;color:#00754f}
.ix-ch.tkt{background:#fdecea;color:#b23a2b}
.ix-ch.ins{background:#fdf1e2;color:#9a5c0d}
.ix-ch.opn{background:#fff;border:1.5px dashed rgba(93,31,114,0.35);color:#5D1F72}
